.el .ds Aq '
.TH QUIPU-SIGNER 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-signer \- Enroll and manage hardware signers for attested writes
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu signer\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Enroll and manage hardware signers for attested writes
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-signer\-enroll(1)
Enroll a hardware signer credential
.TP
quipu\-signer\-status(1)
Show signer enrollment and enforcement state
.TP
quipu\-signer\-enable(1)
Enable signer enforcement
.TP
quipu\-signer\-disable(1)
Disable signer enforcement
.TP
quipu\-signer\-revoke(1)
Revoke a signer credential
.TP
quipu\-signer\-protect\-graph(1)
Permanently require attested writes for a graph
.TP
quipu\-signer\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
